{"mode":"words","text":"Når du lærer ordlister, lærer du ikke et sprog. På denne side kan du se live, hvordan det føles anderledes på få sekunder: Eksempelteksten ovenfor er en ægte app-visning, du kan prøve selv, og denne forklaring læses straks op for dig af en stemme i modersmåls kvalitet, mens ordene lyser op. Med LinguaFlow lærer du sprog på den måde, din hjerne foretrækker: først forstå, derefter lytte, så tale. Metoden bag er inspireret af Birkenbihl-metoden og består af fire trin: afkodning, aktiv lytning, passiv lytning og øvelse. Prøv det – tryk på et ord ovenfor.","words":[{"s":0,"e":221},{"s":244,"e":313},{"s":372,"e":569},{"s":662,"e":1289},{"s":1533,"e":1753},{"s":1811,"e":1892},{"s":1974,"e":2171},{"s":2252,"e":2392},{"s":2426,"e":2891},{"s":3843,"e":3959},{"s":4017,"e":4226},{"s":4284,"e":4493},{"s":4551,"e":4667},{"s":4690,"e":4772},{"s":4818,"e":4946},{"s":5039,"e":5526},{"s":5654,"e":6037},{"s":6095,"e":6165},{"s":6211,"e":6525},{"s":6606,"e":7094},{"s":7210,"e":7303},{"s":7384,"e":7558},{"s":7628,"e":8220},{"s":9172,"e":10054},{"s":10170,"e":10623},{"s":10681,"e":10821},{"s":10890,"e":11007},{"s":11123,"e":11448},{"s":11517,"e":12168},{"s":12191,"e":12272},{"s":12318,"e":12411},{"s":12446,"e":12702},{"s":12736,"e":13166},{"s":13491,"e":13596},{"s":13630,"e":13839},{"s":13886,"e":14339},{"s":14420,"e":14757},{"s":14780,"e":15151},{"s":15209,"e":15337},{"s":15407,"e":15523},{"s":15558,"e":15871},{"s":15918,"e":15964},{"s":16010,"e":16092},{"s":16161,"e":16545},{"s":16614,"e":16672},{"s":16742,"e":17404},{"s":17485,"e":18251},{"s":18576,"e":18808},{"s":18890,"e":19157},{"s":19203,"e":19470},{"s":19505,"e":19853},{"s":20805,"e":20991},{"s":21072,"e":21827},{"s":22071,"e":22350},{"s":22396,"e":22466},{"s":22500,"e":22814},{"s":22895,"e":22988},{"s":23058,"e":23209},{"s":23278,"e":23592},{"s":23615,"e":23778},{"s":23801,"e":24161},{"s":24219,"e":25043},{"s":25426,"e":25693},{"s":25740,"e":26436},{"s":26819,"e":27353},{"s":27411,"e":28038},{"s":28422,"e